{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Player airship slips.","id":"866825622390702090","name":"the-raven-queen","position":165,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I think your fortune is a little bit too late cap. I already made my dangerous transaction.\" The nameless chuckles, albeit somewhat nervously. \"Got any other for me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:12:01.480000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867770969274843156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"It's a three card reading, ace.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:14:48.040000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867771667879297046","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Oh gotcha, gotcha.\" The nameless says as he goes silent as he waits for the reading to finish.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:18:37.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867772629046132786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Well... no other thoughts from you? Because that's all of mine. If you ask me for more words, I might have to charge ya,\" she jokes.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:20:49.432000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867773183665897483","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"So is it three cards, one card, uhhh.... I'm lost cap, haven't done this kind of thing before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:22:09.396000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T14:22:48.268000Z","id":"867773519059222610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Up to you. There are one card readings. Usually, it's just a yes, no or maybe. There are a bunch of three card layouts. It was on the spot so I didn't give you any options.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:25:29.912000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867774360085331978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"There's classic Past-Present-Future, Health-Spirit-Mind, Stop-Start-Continue. List goes on.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:26:03.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867774501205966858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Oh gotcha..?\" The nameless responds, still lost. \"Did this thing a lot back then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:26:15.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867774551387537428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"It's kind of muscle memory at this point.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:26:40.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867774658173206578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That's actually real impressive. Did you also run scams back then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:27:36.325000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867774890300145715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I guess you could call them scams.\" She continues to play with the deck. \"I never did anything to hurt anyone on purpose. In fact, it was basically a kindness! But uh, yeah, I guess you could say I lied to people, and that makes it a scam.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:29:25.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867775348095713280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Well there are white lies. If it made people happy and you didn't hurt their feelings. I'd say you were doing a service actually. Sometimes a little bit of lying helps us come to terms with this harsh reality we find ourselves in. It's better to think that something good is waiting by the corner instead of just being told everything's gonna go to shit. Right?\" The nameless says in a bout of philosophizing.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:31:22.993000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867775841013596201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That's what I always say! Not in those exact words, of course. But, people should always hear nice things every now and then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:39:48.159000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867777959833370674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Definitely. And if you allow me to borrow your deck for now, I'd still like to get my own soon. I'll very much continue your work of spreading the good word. This city sure does need that.\" The nameless smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:42:16.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867778580686831657","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"The city isn't your whole responsibility, mister. You're Speaker of the *Dead*. Not the Empire.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:43:39.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867778929170186291","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She purses her lips. \"Spirits don't always have the nicest things to say. Sugarcoating isn't your job.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:44:04.371000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867779034464911360","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Fine, fine. I'll only speak nice things if the dead want me to. Happy co-worker?\" The nameless says as he slowly realizes that him and Irynx both work for the ravens now.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:46:24.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867779624011169833","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Also you know what.\" The nameless says quickly. \"I'll just find my own deck of cards.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:47:20.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867779855043264543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"...Why?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:47:35.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867779919069052960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"There's sentimental value to yours and you've already given me so much. I don't want to keep free-loading of my cap'n.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:47:45.984000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867779963976941598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Plus I don't think it'll be much of spiritual guidance if the marks tell me what I draw you know?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:48:08.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867780058651557898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Okay, I see what you're getting at. In a way, I'm still right. It's not gonna be your job to sugarcoat things.\" Irynx shuffles the deck. \"I always made sure to draw cards I knew people would like. That's why I marked them. The dead don't deserve that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:50:12.959000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T14:52:14.962000Z","id":"867780580433985566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That is an extremely good point. I don't think I have the self-control to not use the marks to my advantage just yet.\" The nameless chuckles as he turns to look at the sky and just contemplate. \"Thanks for the offer though, you've helped me so much Irynx. Even though I haven't helped you much back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:52:10.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781075132612639","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"No, you have not,\" she laughs. \"It's fine though.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:52:48.017000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781230796079134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You wanna know something I said to the ravens when they asked me if I wanted to speak for the dead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:53:36.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781432923258890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Obviously you said yes.\" She rolls her eyes. Still smiling, though.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:54:19.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781615333277726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I told them that I would in exchange for power.\" The nameless says, the last part slowly leaving his lips. He turns around to see Irynx's reaction.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:55:01.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781790088298537","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Her smile drops.","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:55:30.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781913196232704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Of course you did.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:55:38.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867781944930336829","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The nameless smiles, he expected the reaction. \"But, I said something more. Stop frowning and let me finish. I'm no longer just a power-hungry dude anymore. I've changed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:56:57.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867782276791402507","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She tilts her head around. \"Evidence shows....\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:58:42.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867782717025943552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I said, I wanted power not just for the sake of having it. I wanted power so that I can protect and support my friends.\" He says with a smile. \"I don't want to be the dude who always depends on others anymore. I want to be someone reliable. I want to pay back all those who helped me, by helping them in return.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T14:59:06.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867782819710894120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"So you won't just see me in the back just chucking magic and hoping I hit while others heal me or take hits for me. I'll be actively using my new Speaker for the Dead powers to guide my friends, those living and not, to better things.\" The nameless turns to fully face Irynx. \"So yeah, you're pilot has changed now cap. I've grown a bit I feel.\" He smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:03:23.294000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867783895339630592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx scrunches up her face. \"I mean, magic is crazy powerful. You've just been doing a shit job of taking care of yourself. You weren't meant to be taking hits. That's the point.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:04:56.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867784285598908420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She punches your shoulder gently. \"You don't have to be all things. There was a place for your old self but... if you're happy with where you are now, then that's great.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:05:47.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867784501534523392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The nameless smiles but it suddenly fades away. \"My old self got you killed so I'm happy the ravens gave me something different.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:06:42.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867784731701280808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You can't seriously blame yourself for me dying the other day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:07:05.900000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867784829018177546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The nameless is quiet","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:07:27.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867784918128787466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I told you before, this city is a killer. Stop being stupid.\" She ruffles his hair. \"Life sucks if you blame yourself for things that aren't even your fault.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:09:02.835000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867785319477411850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Fine, I'll stop blaming myself. But for real,\" The nameless's look turns playful again. \"You can trust on me to keep our crew safe now. I've got new magic and some of it's healing. So I got our back.\" His smile returns.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:11:08.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867785845464760360","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Oh, that's great! Let's work on getting you some *armor* too, yeah?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:11:47.984000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867786012162785290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
