{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"It's not that she doesn't trust him with being the healer. Quite the opposite in fact. She's very glad someone can throw that out in a pinch.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:14:35.377000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T15:22:58.171000Z","id":"867786714260045824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
