{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She tucks two health potions into <@740639937677754539>'s bag.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:15:28.828000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867786938450837536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The nameless sees all of the potions. \"Well I won't be just healing, I can help better ourselves and stuff now.\" He remarks as he pouts at the seeming distrust at his newfound capabilities.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:16:25.916000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867787177894215691","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"All I'm saying is, I like where I am now and I'll do better.\" He says, continuing the pout.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:16:53.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867787292034203669","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I'm sorry. It's just, better to be prepared, you know? What would have happened to us back in Jameco if I didn't have that crowbar? Or the rope?\" Irynx exhales loudly. \"If I didn't have a healing potion on me, you'd have died in there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:19:10.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867787867336867860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I'm used to taking care of things, okay? I like being prepared. Tell me, who's going to heal you if you go down?\" She wiggles a potion vial in the air. \"This guy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:19:18.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867787903571984424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Yeah, yeah. I understand.\" The nameless replies begrudgningly. \"I'm just saying my new powers are cool is all, just let me have my moment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:20:17.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867788148200046612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"And you will, for many times in the future. Because this city is a killer.\" She pats his shoulder. \"And now you're the one who gets to stand in its way. I just don't want to stand behind you when you do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:24:35.788000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789232567615519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Well someone's gotta stand up to it right?\" The nameless smirks. \"Speaking of the city, I'm gonna go get a candle real quick.\" He says as he leaves the ship.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:26:07.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789619269599252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Careful! If you're going to the city, it will literally try to kill you!\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:26:45.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789778673074177","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I'm not even joking this time. There's just a fuckton of thorns. It's impossible to get anywhere!\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:27:00.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789840044785705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I'll just make use of my new healing powers then I guess.\" The nameless sighs as he goes to leave.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:27:28.490000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789956931387424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She hands you a healing potion. \"In case you get tapped out.\" And then a goodberry. \"And this too. You can probably drop by Murry Hill Park for more. Stay safe, okay?\"\n\n(berry heals 9 hp)","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:28:25.474000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867790195939213333","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
